OL,1,V7w3s7s35                          G4/19
OL,2,V55555555CSURVIVAL SNOW-HOLE
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CCLIMBERS RESCUED
OL,4,         C
OL,5, Three climbers were brought safely down
OL,6, a mountain by rescuers after spending
OL,7, more than 20 hours in survival snow
OL,8, holes as gales raged about them.
OL,10, One of the three abseiled down the
OL,11, mountain to raise the alarm after they
OL,12, were trapped overnight in freezing
OL,13, conditions and 75mph winds.
OL,15, Rescuers found his two companions in
OL,16, snow holes on the 3,400ft Corrie Nam
OL,17, Lochan ridge in Glencoe.
OL,19, All three were reported to be very cold
OL,20, and wet and were taken to hospital in
OL,21, Fort William.
OL,23,F]DFrom 05-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
